      "summary": "Google is launching Gemini 3.6 Flash alongside a new security model dedicated to quickly finding and patching security vulnerabilities. In a blog post on Tuesday, Google describes Gemini 3.5 Flash Cyber as a \"cost-efficient and highly capable alternative\" to larger, more expensive AI systems, such as the one offered by…",
